<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Northern Fury 33, Into the night!</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;Northern Fury 33,&lt;/B&gt; &lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;Into the Night&lt;/B&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;10 March 1994, 1300 Zulu, 1500 Local&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;The new global war between East and West has been raging for a month, NATO is on the offensive but the Warsaw Pact is far from defeated and still has the ability to counter attack.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The ground war in Europe continues to be brutal and deadly, after Berlin and Copenhagen fell, the Danish Government collapsed but the Germans continue to govern out of Bonn. Danish air and naval forces are generally still fighting alongside NATO counterparts but they have taken heavy casualties. Aircraft losses in central Europe count in the thousands, troops in the tens of thousands on both sides. Over 100 ships and patrol vessels have been sunk in the Baltic alone. Conflicts in the Caribbean, Mediterranean, Persian Gulf and Indian Ocean have stabilized in NATO’s favour, both the Panama and Suez Canals remain open and navigable. In the Pacific, 7&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet has opened a corridor to Japan through the Philippines and Taiwan, it is tenuous but holding.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;South Korea is still under constant air threat but some supply and reinforcements, heavily escorted have reached Busan.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS Constellation has retired to San Diego after sustaining heavy losses amongst her air group, which is now operating out of Clark Field.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS New Jersey was struck by 3 torpedoes but limped to Manila where it remains tied up, unlikely to put to sea again.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (STRIKFLTLANT) is now in the second phase of its counter attack in the Atlantic.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Fighting on Iceland continues but 2 MEF believes that they will have the island clear within the week. A massive NATO attack will be going in tomorrow aimed at halting Soviet plans to seize Oslo&lt;/SPAN&gt;. Under the cover of that operation tonight’s job is to sneak in and insert several Special Forces teams and link with Norwegian elements in the Soviet rear area.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This scenario is playable by NATO only:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;During the fast-moving Soviet drive to the south of Norway, many small pockets of Norwegian soldiers, home guard, loyal citizens and rugged outdoorsman were left behind. Some have been rounded up and either incarcerated or killed, some have fled to Sweden, and some have frozen to death in the rugged mountains. But most have organized themselves into a very effective force of partisans which have caused significant disruption in the Soviet rear area.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;This force is centered on the famous Telemark Battalion, which was screening for Brigade Nord when the Soviets bypassed them with airmobile assaults.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The battalion simply headed for the mountains, collected every able bodied civilian and straggler they could find and started attacking the Soviets vulnerable logistics links.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;After a month of this 'cat and mouse' game, STRIKFLETLANT has decided that they would be a valuable source of intelligence and assistance for upcoming operations, and wants to reinforce them with Special Forces (SOF), communications equipment and information.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;To this end your task is to insert several SOF teams into Norway’s far north. The Soviets wouldn’t suspect a thing!&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Designer’s Notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This is the 33rd scenario of a campaign. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;The 3&lt;SUP&gt;rd&lt;/SUP&gt; World war started 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;India has declared a separate war with Pakistan, North Korea attacked Southwards in an apparently independent move and Argentina is threatening the Falklands again (but has not attacked).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;In earlier scenarios to this battle set, you found that the defences in North Norway have collapsed; the Soviet Northern Fleet has put to sea; and Soviet submarines are inflicting damage along the US Eastern seaboard. Iceland fell into Soviet hands, and an attempt has been made to interdict the Sea and Air Lines of Communications between North America and Europe. The 2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet (US) and &lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet + NATO forces) heavily supported by USAF and RAF elements have largely retaken Iceland. The fighting in Norway has been stagnating but events over the past 24 hours are indicating a renewed with a Soviet push toward Oslo.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, but more importantly for completing your mission.&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;You should strive to remain undetected.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;If shooting starts, things will become a whole lot more interesting.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Soviet forces have random starting positions.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;House Rule&lt;/B&gt;: Note that Command does not check for depth when launching RHIBs out of a DDS (Dry Dock Shelter). I suspect that in reality you would need to surface but am not certain.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;For the purposes of this scenario you should be a Periscope depth to launch a RHIB, and you should remain at that depth until the RHIB docks again in order to maintain communications.&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
